  "description": "APP Kirrane Auctioneering are delighted to bring to market this sunning opportunity to acquire a large site consisting of 0.35 hectares (0.86 acres) approximately.  On folio RN46850F in Carrick, Ballinlough, Co. Roscommon, next to eircode F45 Open countryside views and only a short drive to Ballinlough village and larger towns of Ballyhaunis and Castlerea with a wider variety of shops, service providers, employment opportunities, secondary schools and Westport to Dublin train service.  \n\nThis site offers full planning permission for a detached dormer bungalow consisting of 303.76m2.  Offering four double bedrooms with en-suites, office, gym, kitchen, utility room, dining, living room, sitting room, bathroom, guest w.c.  Ground floor consisting of 245.76m2 and the upstairs offering 58 mt2.  Planning permission to construct a detached garage also on the site.  This will be an ideal family home with space for a vegetable plot or room for pets.\n\nThe property location is central with scenic walks, fishing lakes, golf clubs and an array of employment opportunities within a short drive.  Only an hours drive to Galway City, Sligo, Athlone or Westport.\n\nWhy live in the city when you can have a bespoke custom designed home in the open countryside with space to explore and still be within a daily commute.  \n\nFor further information or to arrange viewing please make contact with the Sole Selling Agents APP Kirrane Auctioneering where everything we touch turns to SOLD.\n\nPlease Note: These particulars are for general information only for this property. The details contained are not to be relied upon as statements or representations of fact. Whilst every care is taken in the preparation of the property details, neither APP Kirrane Auctioneering or the vendor accept any liability for the details contained in the description of the property. The interested persons must satisfy themselves by viewing the property or employ somebody to inspect the property on their behalf. No Auctioneer or Staff Member employed by APP Kirrane Auctioneering in either; Main Street, Ballyhaunis, Co. Mayo or Bohermore, Galway has any authority to make or give any representation or warranty whatever in relation to this property.\n",
